## 📝 Documentation Hygiene

**DO NOT create new .md files without explicit user request.**

**Before creating any document, ask:**
1. Can this go in an existing file? (CONSOLIDATE > CREATE)
2. Can this be a code comment instead? (CODE > DOCS)
3. Will someone actually read this? (If no, don't write it)

**Rules:**
- NEVER create files in Documents/ without asking first
- PREFER adding sections to existing files over new files
- PREFER code comments over separate documentation
- KEEP explanations in code, not in external docs

**Required docs only:** README.md, AGENTS.md, 00_Index, TODO.md
**Everything else must justify its existence.**

**See:** `./Documents/reference/DOCUMENTATION_HYGIENE.md` for full guidelines

